Retro Mode</strong> \u2013 A love letter to the old-school era, featuring filters and effects that recreate the iconic arcade aesthetics of the '80s.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635080/extras/54fb781144fad8a6ab8aaa9b51db757d.poster.avif?t=1769942855\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635080/extras/54fb781144fad8a6ab8aaa9b51db757d.webm?t=1769942855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635080/extras/54fb781144fad8a6ab8aaa9b51db757d.mp4?t=1769942855\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Normal Mode</strong> \u2013 A crisp, filter-free presentation for those who prefer a more modern look.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635080/extras/ea1ea1469a206d8d209ba9868ec41d0f.poster.avif?t=1769942855\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635080/extras/ea1ea1469a206d8d209ba9868ec41d0f.webm?t=1769942855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635080/extras/ea1ea1469a206d8d209ba9868ec41d0f.mp4?t=1769942855\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Cosmic Battle for Survival</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Story Mode</strong>, you take on the role of Jack, a young boy who stumbles upon a mysterious arcade machine in an abandoned game center\u2014only to be pulled into an intergalactic war. To save the galaxy, he must pilot a powerful starfighter and recover the <strong>nine magic cubes</strong> stolen by the invading Martians.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635080/extras/6b63b6f7706eaca871289c4825bab02c.poster.avif?t=1769942855\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635080/extras/6b63b6f7706eaca871289c4825bab02c.webm?t=1769942855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635080/extras/6b63b6f7706eaca871289c4825bab02c.mp4?t=1769942855\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each playthrough is a high-stakes challenge where you'll upgrade your ship, unlock legendary weapons, and battle relentless enemies across <strong>nine unique worlds</strong>. Can you stop the plague before it's too late?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Mode</strong> \u2013 Conquer <strong>nine worlds</strong>, each with <strong>14 action-packed stages</strong> and an <strong>epic boss fight</strong> at the end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635080/extras/ce2d7cc52ec493ac25b7265ce882cb13.avif?t=1769942855\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Arcade Mode</i></strong> (Extreme Survival): Test your skills in the ultimate challenge and compete to be the best player in the world on the global leaderboards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade and achievement system to enhance your ship and skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635080/extras/9540a79276efffd8bad379591bb2357b.avif?t=1769942855\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 30 types of enemies and more than 20 final bosses that will test your skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635080/extras/0b9b9ce5cff8d0614c1776b22e23fdfb.avif?t=1769942855\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different weapon configurations with 9 weapons and 10 special abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635080/extras/3592b93a0a8a7bc7f52bbb80f0305cfd.avif?t=1769942855\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It also features 6 extra challenges, which are unlocked as you progress through the game. Each challenge has 14 levels plus the final enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635080/extras/4dd34b22ad097dca15d4a2ed77f71570.avif?t=1769942855\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A dynamic sci-fi soundtrack</strong> blending <strong>16-bit retro vibes</strong> with cyberpunk and cinematic influences\u2014immersing you in an epic space adventure worthy of a classic anime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635080/extras/4cf776821a452472dd51f4e53db25506.poster.avif?t=1769942855\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635080/extras/4cf776